WEBVTT

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.820
You wrote it down. Then you forgot it was there.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:09.190
NoteFlow reads every note, and pulls out the todos and reminders hiding inside.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.640
No time in the note? It asks. It never guesses.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.120
Ask a question, and it answers from your own notes, with the sources.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.330
NoteFlow. Capture, understand, organize, act.
